  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 养蜂人小屋\" width=\"100%\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=请我喝杯咖啡&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=成为赞助者&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=加入我们的Discord&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=维基&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"维基\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes - 养蜂人小屋是一个小型附加组件，添加了养蜂人小屋结构。该结构可在草甸和繁花森林生物群系中找到。您可以查看<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>以获取关于养蜂人的更多信息。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut1.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" alt=\"养蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut2.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" alt=\"养蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他附加组件 / 数据包</span></p><hr><ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞菇</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社区</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎随时<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的Discord服务器社区</a>进行聊天、分享您的创作、提出任何问题，或仅仅是了解模组的最新开发动态，并在新版本发布时获得通知。同时，也请随时<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过GitHub问题报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">无论是否有支持，我都会继续开发我的模组，因为这是我的爱好，尽管我的大部分空闲时间都投入到了模组的开发中。所以，如果您仍然想支持我，可以通过<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>进行支持。话虽如此，我真心感谢您所有的支持。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 许可证</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组采用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>许可证。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎查阅我的代码，作为我在编写此模组时如何实现和解决各种问题的示例，并将代码片段融入您自己的代码中。同时，也欢迎在任何整合包中使用此模组（尽管若能注明出处或链接回此页面，将不胜感激）。</span></p>",
